  added nset==<nset_label> to the expressions of -shownode, added
  -orisym (sample symmetry in orientation space), added the
  visualization of cohesive elements (-show{eltco,elsetco},
  -data{eltco,elsetco}{col,colscheme,trs,scale,scaletitle} and
  -dataeltcoedge{col,rad}), made -space rodrigues use ImageMagick 7's
